    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just \"noise\" though. it's the truth. i know who i am. i look in the mirror and i just see someone who messed up so badly that there's no coming back from it. it's like i've poisoned everything i touched. how can anyone say i deserve support when i'm the one who caused all this damage?",
